    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against your friends to in a series of brainrot related minigames to become the brainrot champ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual party game based on popular brainrot trends and memes.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lobby can host up to 16 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 4 game modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame has it's own unique challenge related to the meme the minigame is based off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players earn brainrot in various ways each minigame. The player with the most brainrot at the end of all the minigames WIN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365140/extras/9154c24bf96bc450efb18bc14c9e4666.avif?t=1740586638\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING: Play at own risk, may cause serious brainrot.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against your friends to in a series of brainrot related minigames to become the brainrot champ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual party game based on popular brainrot trends and memes.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lobby can host up to 16 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 4 game modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame has it's own unique challenge related to the meme the minigame is based off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players earn brainrot in various ways each minigame. The player with the most brainrot at the end of all the minigames WIN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365140/extras/9154c24bf96bc450efb18bc14c9e4666.avif?t=1740586638\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING: Play at own risk, may cause serious brainrot.</p>",
